offer.description:
Embroidered 34th Marine Brigade patch featuring a striking wolf design. The combination of dark navy, turquoise, white, and yellow creates a bold and distinctive appearance.

The patch is made on a durable fabric base with detailed machine embroidery. A reinforced stitched border helps it maintain its shape and neat appearance during regular use.

The reverse side features a hook-and-loop backing, making the patch easy to attach to uniforms, plate carriers, tactical vests, backpacks, and other compatible gear.

Features:

size — 7х8 cm;
type — embroidered patch;
theme — 34th Marine Brigade;
